%% SYSTEMS ARCHITECTURE (generalized) — Policy / privacy / redaction (D-33).
%% The trust boundary: nothing personal leaves a local boundary un-vetted. A classifier +
%% redactor + routing decision sit on EVERY outbound seam. (policy.py)
flowchart TD
  req([any outbound or sensitive op — model route / web query / notification / log])
  classify[classify — personal vs shareable, secret detection]
  decide{policy decision — local-only vs external-allowed}
  localonly([force local path])
  redact[redact / sanitize — strip secrets + identifiers]
  ok([release to external seam])

  subgraph enforce[Enforcement points it meshes onto]
    router([model provider router])
    webarm([retrieval web arm])
    notif([notifications])
    logs[(logs / audit)]
  end

  req --> classify --> decide
  decide -->|personal, no opt-in| localonly
  decide -->|external allowed| redact --> ok
  localonly -.-> router
  ok -.-> router
  ok -.-> webarm
  ok -.-> notif
  redact -.-> logs
